      "reviewedAt": "2026-08-24T13:01:12Z",
      "note": "Reviewed the exploit receipt and call trace, the direct creation receipt, runtime bytecode at deployment and immediately before the exploit, and the pinned reproduction. The attacker contract directly calls 0x452e253eeb3bb16e40337d647c01b6c910aa84b3 with selector 0xfa461e33 and fabricated positive deltas of 27.349 WETH. The victim's own runtime handles the call without authenticating msg.sender as the expected Uniswap V3 pool and transfers exactly 27.349 WETH to the caller; the caller forwards that exact amount to the attacker EOA. Transaction 0xca5e3a4285eeda28c26d467c6a7e1b7f19096bd33b8263afc9a6358ab26a51fc is the successful top-level creation of the direct target, whose runtime hash is identical at deployment block 20174655 and pre-exploit block 20223094."
